# src/apps/daemon/internal/platform/process

## Purpose
Daemon process implementation module.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `platform` (rank 1; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

